{"4844510":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Wisp: Elemental Conflict","steam_appid":4844510,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"controller_support":"full","dlc":[4844550],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4844510\/extras\/806a2dfdafa73ea68d5d6c8143c6aff6.avif?t=1793715565\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4844510\/extras_big\/806a2dfdafa73ea68d5d6c8143c6aff6.avif?t=1793715565 width=1560 height=878 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Overview<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  You begin as nothing — a mote of raw magic drifting through a world that doesn't know your name yet. Absorb elemental energy from the world around you,<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  transform your Wisp, and grow powerful enough to challenge a world boss. Then die, bank your Shards, and try again stronger.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  WISP: Elemental Conflict is a top-down elemental roguelike where your build is made of the world itself.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  ---<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4844510\/extras\/dc2b1a6e5fca1cc0b31a957e389c7ac8.poster.avif?t=1793715565\" width=500 height=282 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4844510\/extras\/dc2b1a6e5fca1cc0b31a957e389c7ac8.webm?t=1793715565\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4844510\/extras\/dc2b1a6e5fca1cc0b31a957e389c7ac8.mp4?t=1793715565\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >  Absorb. Shape. Survive.<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Elemental motes scatter across every biome. Collect them. Pour them into your abilities to change how they behave — a Fire Dart ignites on contact, a<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Void Nova shreds, a Crystal Shield erupts with shrapnel when it breaks. The same 11 abilities express themselves across 12 distinct elements: Fire,<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Water, Ice, Lightning, Wind, Earth, Metal, Crystal, Wood, Light, Dark, and Void.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Invest motes into your three body stats — Vitality, Armor, and Mana — to shape who your Wisp becomes. Reallocate freely between runs. Experiment without<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  penalty.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  ---<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >  A Living World at War With Itself<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  The ecosystem isn't waiting for you. It has its own agenda.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  8 distinct creature types compete for resources and territory across every run — and most of them will turn on you the moment you step into their range:<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  - Sprites forage peacefully — until you're the most interesting thing nearby<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  - Hunters sprint and stalk with predatory aggression<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  - Lurkers stalk invisibly and pounce from the shadows<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  - Swarms coordinate in packs — disturb one, disturb all<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  - Sentinels guard their territory with ranged precision<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  - Wraiths fire from distance and retreat when pressed<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  - Colossi are armored tanks that charge and retaliate<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  - Harbingers dodge your shots, raise damage shields, and burst-fire in rings<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  ---<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >  4 Worlds. 12 Biomes. 12 Bosses.<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Every run takes you through one of four worlds — The Burning Reaches, The Fractured Expanse, The Sunken Realm, or The Abyssal Hollow — each home to three<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  elementally themed biomes and a named world boss. The Emberlord. The Tide Sovereign. The Prism Oracle. The Ancient Still. Each boss is a signature<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  elemental encounter. Defeat one to end your run and claim your Shards.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Worlds unlock through meta-progression — each victory opens the door to harder terrain, stranger creatures, and more powerful rewards.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  ---<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >  Grow Between Runs<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Shards are the only currency that survives death. Spend them to expand your mote capacity, unlock new abilities, and push deeper into worlds that don't<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  pull their punches. Every run is a clean slate. Every run builds on everything that came before.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  ---<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >  Key Features<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  - 12 elemental motes — each changes the behavior, visuals, and feel of every ability<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  - 11 abilities — Dart, Dash, Shield, Orb, Lance, Nova, Aura, Teleport, Vortex, Stealth, Seeker<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  - 3 body stats shaped by mote investment — Vitality, Armor, Mana<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  - 8 creature types in a living ecosystem with their own behaviors and rivalries<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  - 12 named elemental bosses, one per biome<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  - 4 worlds across 12 procedurally generated biomes<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  - Persistent meta-progression via Shards — grow permanently between runs<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  - Casual-friendly run length — pick up, play, and put down without losing your footing<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4844510\/extras\/806a2dfdafa73ea68d5d6c8143c6aff6.avif?t=1793715565\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4844510\/extras_big\/806a2dfdafa73ea68d5d6c8143c6aff6.avif?t=1793715565 width=1560 height=878 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Overview<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  You begin as nothing — a mote of raw magic drifting through a world that doesn't know your name yet. Absorb elemental energy from the world around you,<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  transform your Wisp, and grow powerful enough to challenge a world boss. Then die, bank your Shards, and try again stronger.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  WISP: Elemental Conflict is a top-down elemental roguelike where your build is made of the world itself.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  ---<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4844510\/extras\/dc2b1a6e5fca1cc0b31a957e389c7ac8.poster.avif?t=1793715565\" width=500 height=282 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4844510\/extras\/dc2b1a6e5fca1cc0b31a957e389c7ac8.webm?t=1793715565\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4844510\/extras\/dc2b1a6e5fca1cc0b31a957e389c7ac8.mp4?t=1793715565\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >  Absorb. Shape. Survive.<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Elemental motes scatter across every biome. Collect them. Pour them into your abilities to change how they behave — a Fire Dart ignites on contact, a<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Void Nova shreds, a Crystal Shield erupts with shrapnel when it breaks. The same 11 abilities express themselves across 12 distinct elements: Fire,<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Water, Ice, Lightning, Wind, Earth, Metal, Crystal, Wood, Light, Dark, and Void.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Invest motes into your three body stats — Vitality, Armor, and Mana — to shape who your Wisp becomes. Reallocate freely between runs. Experiment without<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  penalty.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  ---<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >  A Living World at War With Itself<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  The ecosystem isn't waiting for you. It has its own agenda.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  8 distinct creature types compete for resources and territory across every run — and most of them will turn on you the moment you step into their range:<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  - Sprites forage peacefully — until you're the most interesting thing nearby<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  - Hunters sprint and stalk with predatory aggression<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  - Lurkers stalk invisibly and pounce from the shadows<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  - Swarms coordinate in packs — disturb one, disturb all<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  - Sentinels guard their territory with ranged precision<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  - Wraiths fire from distance and retreat when pressed<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  - Colossi are armored tanks that charge and retaliate<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  - Harbingers dodge your shots, raise damage shields, and burst-fire in rings<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  ---<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >  4 Worlds. 12 Biomes. 12 Bosses.<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Every run takes you through one of four worlds — The Burning Reaches, The Fractured Expanse, The Sunken Realm, or The Abyssal Hollow — each home to three<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  elementally themed biomes and a named world boss. The Emberlord. The Tide Sovereign. The Prism Oracle. The Ancient Still. Each boss is a signature<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  elemental encounter. Defeat one to end your run and claim your Shards.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Worlds unlock through meta-progression — each victory opens the door to harder terrain, stranger creatures, and more powerful rewards.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  ---<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >  Grow Between Runs<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Shards are the only currency that survives death. Spend them to expand your mote capacity, unlock new abilities, and push deeper into worlds that don't<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  pull their punches. Every run is a clean slate. Every run builds on everything that came before.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  ---<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >  Key Features<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  - 12 elemental motes — each changes the behavior, visuals, and feel of every ability<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  - 11 abilities — Dart, Dash, Shield, Orb, Lance, Nova, Aura, Teleport, Vortex, Stealth, Seeker<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  - 3 body stats shaped by mote investment — Vitality, Armor, Mana<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  - 8 creature types in a living ecosystem with their own behaviors and rivalries<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  - 12 named elemental bosses, one per biome<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  - 4 worlds across 12 procedurally generated biomes<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  - Persistent meta-progression via Shards — grow permanently between runs<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  - Casual-friendly run length — pick up, play, and put down without losing your footing<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p>","short_description":"You start as a simple neutral Wisp. Absorb elemental motes, add elemental effects and strengthen your abilities, build your power, and survive a world that's already at war with itself. 12 elements. 11 abilities. 12 bosses. Permanent progression. Every run, a new chance.","supported_languages":"English","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4844510\/fe0972e9fd44de16f60a60c13a8393daeedf57f7\/header.jpg?t=1793715565","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4844510\/a4bfaf31419ee6d1757eff06abde6dfd2d53d9d8\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793715565","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4844510\/a4bfaf31419ee6d1757eff06abde6dfd2d53d9d8\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793715565","website":"https:\/\/twomotesstudios.com\/","pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i3-6100 \/ AMD Ryzen 3 1200<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 4 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Intel HD Graphics 520 or equivalent integrated<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 11<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 600 MB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Sound Card:<\/strong> DirectX-compatible<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 \/ 11 64-bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i5-8250U \/ AMD Ryzen 5 3500U<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 8 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Intel Iris Xe \/ NVIDIA GTX 1050 \/ AMD RX 560<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 11<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 1 GB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Sound Card:<\/strong> DirectX-compatible<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> macOS 10.15 Catalina<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i5 dual-core 2.0 GHz<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 4 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Intel Iris Plus 640 or equivalent<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 1 GB available space<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> macOS 12 Monterey or later<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i5 quad-core \/ Apple M1 or later<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 8 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Intel Iris Plus 655 \/ Apple M1 integrated \/ NVIDIA 9xx+<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 1 GB available space<\/li><\/ul>"},"linux_requirements":[],"developers":["Two MOTES STUDIOS LLC"],"publishers":["Two MOTES STUDIOS LLC"],"demos":[{"appid":4844550,"description":""}],"price_overview":{"currency":"USD","initial":499,"final":499,"discount_percent":0,"initial_formatted":"","final_formatted":"$4.99"},"packages":[1682904],"package_groups":[{"name":"default","title":"Buy Wisp: Elemental Conflict","description":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","save_text":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","subs":[{"packageid":1682904,"percent_savings_text":" ","percent_savings":0,"option_text":"Wisp: Elemental Conflict - $4.99","option_description":"","can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"price_in_cents_with_discount":499}]}],"platforms":{"windows":true,"mac":true,"linux":false},"categories":[{"id":2,"description":"Single-player"},{"id":22,"description":"Steam Achievements"},{"id":28,"description":"Full controller support"},{"id":55,"description":"DualShock Controller Support"},{"id":56,"description":"DualShock Controller Support"},{"id":57,"description":"DualSense Controller Support"},{"id":58,"description":"DualSense Controller Support"},{"id":23,"description":"Steam Cloud"},{"id":62,"description":"Family Sharing"}],"genres":[{"id":"1","description":"Action"},{"id":"4","description":"Casual"},{"id":"23","description":"Indie"}],"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4844510\/df8b8d0c5b8909b1112009c40d07c38cde413dac\/ss_df8b8d0c5b8909b1112009c40d07c38cde413dac.600x338.jpg?t=1793715565","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4844510\/df8b8d0c5b8909b1112009c40d07c38cde413dac\/ss_df8b8d0c5b8909b1112009c40d07c38cde413dac.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793715565"},{"id":1,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4844510\/8dd315e88d7fc254438a4414870d72067d84c240\/ss_8dd315e88d7fc254438a4414870d72067d84c240.600x338.jpg?t=1793715565","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4844510\/8dd315e88d7fc254438a4414870d72067d84c240\/ss_8dd315e88d7fc254438a4414870d72067d84c240.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793715565"},{"id":2,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4844510\/24b2b1ec029a84c568f40f10571ddda5c8a679bc\/ss_24b2b1ec029a84c568f40f10571ddda5c8a679bc.600x338.jpg?t=1793715565","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4844510\/24b2b1ec029a84c568f40f10571ddda5c8a679bc\/ss_24b2b1ec029a84c568f40f10571ddda5c8a679bc.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793715565"},{"id":3,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4844510\/218e4e7f3a812b4f2330ffc1b9c19c9d3f14cd3c\/ss_218e4e7f3a812b4f2330ffc1b9c19c9d3f14cd3c.600x338.jpg?t=1793715565","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4844510\/218e4e7f3a812b4f2330ffc1b9c19c9d3f14cd3c\/ss_218e4e7f3a812b4f2330ffc1b9c19c9d3f14cd3c.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793715565"},{"id":4,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4844510\/7e2927e3df1650ea0a1ec89d298cd3ff5d9d7893\/ss_7e2927e3df1650ea0a1ec89d298cd3ff5d9d7893.600x338.jpg?t=1793715565","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4844510\/7e2927e3df1650ea0a1ec89d298cd3ff5d9d7893\/ss_7e2927e3df1650ea0a1ec89d298cd3ff5d9d7893.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793715565"}],"movies":[{"id":257365675,"name":"Gameplay","thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/257365675\/ef8c6ad8be239c5bc834803d2169974b04c2ed7f\/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1787950927","dash_av1":"https:\/\/video.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_trailers\/4844510\/1517147931\/49cdfe063ae24be1f1d622f9e87715e94bb5d18c\/1787950614\/dash_av1.mpd?t=1787950927","dash_h264":"https:\/\/video.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_trailers\/4844510\/1517147931\/49cdfe063ae24be1f1d622f9e87715e94bb5d18c\/1787950614\/dash_h264.mpd?t=1787950927","hls_h264":"https:\/\/video.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_trailers\/4844510\/1517147931\/49cdfe063ae24be1f1d622f9e87715e94bb5d18c\/1787950614\/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1787950927","highlight":true}],"achievements":{"total":47,"highlighted":[{"icon":"ccd803a64c7ddf0c84f0642c6de7b02a6c9298bf.jpg","localized_name":"First Spark","archived":0,"hidden":0,"name":"First Spark","path":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/community_assets\/images\/apps\/4844510\/ccd803a64c7ddf0c84f0642c6de7b02a6c9298bf.jpg"},{"icon":"a2ab122f3280cdb5762e98179c36abf2459da3ce.jpg","localized_name":"Ignition","archived":0,"hidden":0,"name":"Ignition","path":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/community_assets\/images\/apps\/4844510\/a2ab122f3280cdb5762e98179c36abf2459da3ce.jpg"},{"icon":"068913330e5df24dde09302dc252d1d65439cc1b.jpg","localized_name":"Investment","archived":0,"hidden":0,"name":"Investment","path":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/community_assets\/images\/apps\/4844510\/068913330e5df24dde09302dc252d1d65439cc1b.jpg"},{"icon":"c408f3e1199be7bae34fc5c48bd921b653fc4d17.jpg","localized_name":"Currency of the Cosmos","archived":0,"hidden":0,"name":"Currency of the Cosmos","path":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/community_assets\/images\/apps\/4844510\/c408f3e1199be7bae34fc5c48bd921b653fc4d17.jpg"},{"icon":"e